00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,324
Three questions.

2
00:00:01,544 --> 00:00:02,792
Can you get all three?

3
00:00:03,012 --> 00:00:03,978
Morning quiz!

4
00:00:04,698 --> 00:00:05,619
Question one.

5
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:07,694
Divide returns two values.

6
00:00:07,914 --> 00:00:08,841
What does it print

7
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:10,025
for seventeen and five?

8
00:00:10,245 --> 00:00:11,342
Pause and answer.

9
00:00:12,062 --> 00:00:12,932
Three two.

10
00:00:13,152 --> 00:00:15,365
Integer division gives three, the

11
00:00:15,365 --> 00:00:16,975
remainder is two, and Go

12
00:00:16,975 --> 00:00:18,585
