13
00:00:19,305 --> 00:00:20,335
Question two.

14
00:00:20,555 --> 00:00:21,822
We drop duplicates

15
00:00:21,822 --> 00:00:22,737
by name only.

16
00:00:22,957 --> 00:00:24,362
How many rows are left?

17
00:00:24,582 --> 00:00:25,679
Pause and answer.

18
00:00:26,399 --> 00:00:27,003
Three.

19
00:00:27,223 --> 00:00:28,859
Only the name is checked,

20
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:30,430
so the second Asha goes,

21
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:32,263
even with a different score.

22
00:00:32,483 --> 00:00:33,734
The first one stays.

23
00:00:34,454 --> 00:00:35,568
Interview question.

24
00:00:35,788 --> 00:00:37,074
You change only one

25
00:00:37,074 --> 00:00:38,157
