28
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,946
Pause and answer.

29
00:00:43,666 --> 00:00:44,223
PATCH!

30
00:00:44,443 --> 00:00:45,339
It updates part

31
00:00:45,339 --> 00:00:46,056
